I played around with the source code of slashem and now i got an owlbear 
that really needs some friends.

As i really like the ideas that were poste, i'd like to share the code:

http://slashem.airmack.de/updated/mhitu.c :
i added the suggested messages when beeing in normal state and when 
hallucinating.

http://slashem.airmack.de/updated/monmove.c :
I added a message that tells the player: "You have the feeling that 
somebody needs a friend.". This message appears randomly when an owlbear 
is present and moving in the dungeon level

You can try it out in wizard mode, generate yourself an owlbear and see 
what i did.

